<noinclude>
TemplateStyles demo template.

Parameters:
* 1 or label = text shown in the badge
* tone = neutral (default), success, warning, danger
* size = normal (default), small

Stylesheet:
* [[Template:TestTemplate/styles.css]]
</noinclude><includeonly><templatestyles src="TestTemplate/styles.css" />
<span class="sb-test-badge sb-test-badge--{{#switch:{{lc:{{{tone|neutral}}}}}|success=success|warning=warning|danger=danger|#default=neutral}} sb-test-badge--{{#switch:{{lc:{{{size|normal}}}}}|small=small|#default=normal}}">{{{label|{{{1|TemplateStyles test}}}}}</span></includeonly><noinclude></noinclude>
